KN IL uses Oracle’s Transportation Manager (OTM) TMS in conjunction with our integrated best-in-breed IT solution landscape designed to support end-to-end supply chain activity.  Our primary set of integrated technologies includes the following:
• Oracle Transportation Manager (OTM version 6.4.1) for transport planning;
• ControLOG, KN IL’s proprietary digital platform, providing access across multiple digital touchpoints including telematics (vehicle based positioning) information and PESTEL data sources (i.e., Political, Economic, Social, Technological, Environmental, and Legal) for shipment visibility. This information, combined with Customer-provided order information enables proactive identification of potential and actual shipment risks that are prioritized for resolution;
• Business Objects and Tableau for business intelligence, data visualization and cost / performance reporting.
